# Build output directory

- GN/Ninja **gen roots** are **`out/Debug`** (`is_debug=true`) and **`out/Release`** (`is_debug=false`). Binaries live under those dirs (`out/Debug/build.ninja`, `out/Release/SmartGisViews.exe`, …).
- **Do not** use bare **`out/`** as a gen root. **Do not** use **`out/Default`**.
- Default **`build.bat`** builds **both** configs. Prefer a single config when iterating: `build.bat debug …` / `build.bat release …`.
- Shared (not a gen root):
  - `out/environment.x64.x64` (copied into each config dir for `ninja -t msvc`)
  - `out/third_party` ? `third_party/.install` junction
  - **`out/data/`** — sample maps / DEM / AM terrain (GN `//testing/data:china_map_samples` writes `$root_out_dir/../data`)
  - **`out/ui/`** — Views markup `.ui.xml` / `.ui.css` (GN `//src/ui/views:markup_resources` writes `$root_out_dir/../ui`)
- Logs: `out/Debug/build.log`, `out/Release/build.log`.
- Resolve product/test binaries under **`out/Debug/`** (default for `te` / `e2e` runners) or **`out/Release/`**.
- Third-party CMake install prefix remains **`out/third_party`** (junction to `.install`). Do not invent a second install root.
- Do not use `vs2008/SmartGIS.sln` as a build entry.

```bat
build.bat
build.bat debug
build.bat release te
gn gen out/Debug --root=./ --args="is_debug=true is_build_third_party=false"
ninja -C out/Debug all
```

## Agent compile

Agents **may** run `build.bat`, `gn`, `ninja`, and `out/Debug|Release/*.exe` when fixing or verifying builds/tests. Prefer repo-root **`build.bat`** (use `build.bat debug …` for a faster loop). See **`.cursor/rules/build/agent-may-build.mdc`**. Do not invent `third_party/.install` as a gen root; do not use `SmartGIS.sln` / MSBuild as the fix loop.
